\cf0 First Impression\
\pard\pardeftab560\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf0 {\listtext	0.	}The overall look and feel of NGS looks 
\f1\b a little cluttered and dated compared with the rest of the competitors
\f0\b0 . \uc0\u8232 \u8232 \
{\listtext	0.	}There are only two sections on the homepage \'96 banner carousel and highlights. Both sections are large and used to house a variety of content \'96 exhibits, visiting the museum. It is 
\f1\b not clear to the user what to focus on
\f0\b0 .\uc0\u8232 \u8232 \
{\listtext	0.	}Google Arts and Culture and Rijks Museum have several smaller sections focused on different needs, helping to pique users\'92 interests and guide them to explore further.\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
