\f1\b \cf0 Navigation\
\pard\pardeftab560\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0
\f0\b0 \cf0 {\listtext	0.	}The navigation categories for NGS are clear, but 
\f1\b greater organization within the sub-menu items 
\f0\b0 would be helpful. There are also 
\f1\b too many items
\f0\b0  in both the primary and secondary navigation, which can be overwhelming for users.\uc0\u8232 \u8232 \
{\listtext	0.	}The Van Gogh Museum, The Met, and Rijks Museum have more concise navigation menus. There are less than 7 items in each navigation level, which is the recommended practice, according to 
\f1\b Miller\'92s Law
\f0\b0  on working memory.\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab560\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0\cf0 {\listtext	0.	}The usage of 
\f1\b campaign and program names
\f0\b0  (e.g. #GalleryAnywhere, Resonates with Residency) in the NGS sub-menu items may be 
\f1\b confusing to the user
\f0\b0  if they are unfamiliar with the offerings.\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab560\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0\cf0 {\listtext	0.	}Naming for each section and items in the sub-menu for The Van Gogh Museum, The Met, and Rijks Museum are clear and unambiguous, so the user does not have to second-guess on where each page will lead them.\
